{"id":"dd12b5b0-3972-40ab-9a1a-a8b332a00f86","rule_id":"8cb84371-d053-4f4f-bce0-c74990e28f28","name":"【默认】Linux疑似爆破后登录成功","immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"version":17,"revision":8,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T06:08:32.956Z","updated_by":"elastic","created_at":"2026-09-07T03:13:30.905Z","created_by":"elastic","enabled":true,"interval":"5m","from":"now-9m","to":"now","description":"检测短时间多次登录失败后紧接着登录成功的行为。对应需求：用户登录失败（爆破成功）。","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 身份安全","来源: 默认","规则来源: 默认","用例: 身份与访问审计","对应需求: 登录失败"],"author":["Elastic"],"license":"Elastic License v2","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1110","name":"Brute Force","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1110/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1110.001","name":"Password Guessing","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1110/001/"},{"id":"T1110.003","name":"Password Spraying","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1110/003/"}]}]},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1078","name":"Valid Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/"}]}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","host.id","user.name","user.id","source.ip","source.port","event.action","event.outcome","event.category","message","event.original","related.user","related.ip","agent.id"]},"related_integrations":[{"package":"system","version":">=2.0.0"}],"required_fields":[{"name":"event.action","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"event.outcome","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"host.id","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"host.os.type","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"source.ip","type":"ip","ecs":true},{"name":"user.name","type":"keyword","ecs":true}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend** 与/或 **System** / **auditd**（按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n3. 可用演示脚本做触发验证。\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n失败多次后登录成功。\n\n### 为何重要\n高度可疑，优先当失陷处理。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 立即限制该账号会话。\n2. 强制改密并审查命令历史。\n3. 封禁源地址。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维操作\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则回滚变更、禁用相关账号并轮换凭证。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后身份类告警。\n","false_positives":["用户多次输错后最终输对"],"references":[],"risk_score":73,"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity":"high","severity_mapping":[],"output_index":"","max_signals":100,"exceptions_list":[],"actions":[],"type":"eql","language":"eql","index":["auditbeat-*","filebeat-*","logs-system.auth-*"],"query":"sequence by host.id, source.ip, user.name with maxspan=15s\n  [authentication where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.action  in (\"ssh_login\", \"user_login\") and\n   event.outcome == \"failure\" and source.ip != null and source.ip != \"0.0.0.0\" and source.ip != \"::\" ] with runs=25\n  [authentication where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.action  in (\"ssh_login\", \"user_login\") and\n   event.outcome == \"success\" and source.ip != null and source.ip != \"0.0.0.0\" and source.ip != \"::\" ]\n"}
